        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_Town_01Gra_22:Town_01Gra_22_010:ef7c66ca",
        "jp_sha256": "0408027526dc471b9ee173cdaf2cdcc79c7ba66091798cf5d1e9008f809e033d",
        "official_en_sha256": "3e53821a933151182b1fdf4e665239be059c9df2544c09df22544974a88163d0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「グランシェルト騎士の精神」……。\r\nこの本、騎士団に入ってから\r\n何度も読まされたよな。",
        "official_en": "It’s my copy of <text style=\"italic\">Knights of Grandshelt: Ethos and Spirit</>... I’ve lost count of how many times they made me read through this when I joined the Order.",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">The Spirit of the Knights of Grandshelt</>... They made us read this book over and over after we joined the Order, remember?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_Town_01Gra_22",
